BT /F2 18.0 Tf 72 696 Td (Neural Attention for Cross-Lingual Document Comprehension) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 671 Td (Alice Zhang, Bob Martin and Carol Lee) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.0 Tf 72 639 Td (Abstract) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 603 Td (We present a neural attention framework for cross-lingual document comprehension. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 587 Td (model aligns word embeddings across languages with a shared transformer encoder and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 571 Td (token-level attention scorer. On two multilingual benchmarks, our approach improves) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 555 Td (exact-match accuracy by 4.2 points over the previous state of the art, while reducing) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 539 Td (inference latency by 18 percent. We further analyze the learned attention weights and) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 523 Td (show that cross-lingual alignment emerges in the lower layers of the encoder.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 507 Td (Keywords: attention, transformer, cross-lingual, embedding, benchmark) Tj ET
BT /F2 13.0 Tf 72 475 Td (1. Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 439 Td (Understanding documents across languages is central to multilingual information) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 423 Td (retrieval and question answering. Existing systems translate the input text before) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 407 Td (comprehension, which introduces propagation errors and extra latency. In this paper we) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 391 Td (propose a single model that reads the source language directly and reasons over a) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 375 Td (shared embedding space. Our main contribution is a token-level attention mechanism) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 359 Td (that reweights source tokens according to their relevance to the query, independent of) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 343 Td (the surface language. We evaluate the framework on two public benchmarks and report) Tj ET
BT /F1 12.0 Tf 72 327 Td (both accuracy and latency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11.0 Tf 72 311 Td (Figure 1: Overview of the proposed attention-based framework, including the shared encoder and the token scorer.) Tj ET
endstream
